# Domain entities

Layout: `domain/entities/<entity>/` (kebab-case, singular). Etalon: `masters/.../master-service`.

## Files

- `i-<entity>.entity.ts` — `I*Entity` / `I*PublicEntity`; money → `string`
- `i-<entity>-relations.ts` — only if real includes exist
- `i-create-<entity>.input.ts` / `i-update-<entity>.input.ts`
- `<entity>-select-fields.ts` — `*_SELECT_FIELDS` + `*_STAFF_ONLY_FIELDS`
- enums/constants, `policies/`, `errors/`, `index.ts`

## Shape

- Entity = **interface**, not class-aggregate
- Behavior = **pure** policies (`ensure*`, `build*`, `resolve*`)
- Update: all optional; `null` = clear, `undefined` = leave; no id/timestamps
- Select lists — SoT here; presets live in presentation mappers

## Do not

- Import Nest / Prisma / application ports / infrastructure
- Put I/O or orchestration in policies
- Duplicate select field arrays in presentation as a second SoT
